 "description": "An official website of the State of Maryland.",
 "main_html": "<section class=\"mdgov-section\">\n<div id=\"ctl00_PlaceHolderMain_editmodepanel2\">\n<h1 class=\"mdgov-section__heading\">Residential and Commercial Energy Storage Program</h1>\n</div>\n<div id=\"ctl00_PlaceHolderMain_RichHtmlField1_label\" style=\"display:none\">Main_Content</div><div aria-labelledby=\"ctl00_PlaceHolderMain_RichHtmlField1_label\" class=\"ms-rtestate-field\" id=\"ctl00_PlaceHolderMain_RichHtmlField1__ControlWrapper_RichHtmlField\" style=\"display:inline\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">\n<img alt=\"white battery bank storgae hanging on a wall\" src=\"/SiteAssets/Pages/Energy-Storage-Grant-Program/RCES%20Program%20Image.jpg\" style=\"margin:5px;width:800px;height:400px;\"/>​<br/></p><p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<strong style=\"font-size:1rem;\"></strong></p><span><span><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>**Attention**</strong></div><div><p></p><p style=\"text-align:center;\">The Fiscal Year 2027 (FY27) program is <strong class=\"ms-rteThemeForeColor-7-0\" style=\"text-decoration:underline;\">now open</strong> in the <a href=\"https://mea.maryland.gov/\" target=\"_blank\">My MEA Application Portal</a>, with the specifics of the Residential and Commercial Energy Storage  (RCES) Program viewable <a href=\"https://mea.maryland.gov/rces-program-details\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.  <br/></p><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"ms-rteTable-6\" style=\"width:100%;\"><tbody><tr class=\"ms-rteTableEvenRow-6\"><td class=\"ms-rteTableEvenCol-6\" style=\"width:50%;\">​<strong>Ty​​pe of Program: </strong><br/></td><td class=\"ms-rteTableOddCol-6\" style=\"width:50%;\">​Rebate Program (to be eligible, an upfront program reservation is required prior to installation)<br/></td></tr><tr class=\"ms-rteTableOddRow-6\"><td class=\"ms-rteTableEvenCol-6\"><strong>​Target Audience:</strong><br/></td><td class=\"ms-rteTableOddCol-6\">​Residential households, commercial and nonprofit organizations <br/></td></tr><tr class=\"ms-rteTableEvenRow-6\"><td class=\"ms-rteTableEvenCol-6\">​<strong>Application Deadline:</strong><br/></td><td class=\"ms-rteTableOddCol-6\">​<strong>3:00 PM Eastern Time May 31, 2027</strong> <br/>The application portal may close earlier if budgeted funds are fully requested. <br/></td></tr><tr class=\"ms-rteTableOddRow-6\"><td class=\"ms-rteTableEvenCol-6\"><strong>Application Submission through the My MEA online portal:</strong><br/></td><td class=\"ms-rteTableOddCol-6\">​<a href=\"http://mea.maryland.gov/\" target=\"_blank\">MEA.maryland.gov</a><br/></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p><strong>FY27 Anticipated Program Budget: </strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#222222;font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:center;\">MEA anticipates up to $4 million will be available from the Strategic Energy Investment Fund (“SEIF”) for rebates awarded under this Program. The total amount may be more or less, at MEA’s discretion.</span></p></div></span></span><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><span><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;color:#222222;background-color:transparent;font-variant:normal;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\"><br/>MEA will update this table regularly, and post the date of the last update below the table.</span></p></span></div><div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"ms-rteTable-4\" style=\"text-align:center;height:101px;\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"ms-rteTableHeaderRow-4\"><th class=\"ms-rteTableHeaderEvenCol-4\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"width:525.125px;text-align:center;\">\n<span style=\"font-weight:600;\">​TOTAL FY26 RCES GRANT PROGRAM BUDGET</span><br/></th><th class=\"ms-rteTableHeaderOddCol-4\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"width:525.125px;\"><div style=\"text-align:center;\">​<span style=\"color:#ffffff;font-weight:600;text-align:center;background-color:#005594;\">​TOTAL FUNDING </span></div><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"color:#ffffff;font-weight:600;text-align:center;background-color:#005594;\">REQUESTED</span><br/></div></th><th class=\"ms-rteTableHeaderEvenCol-4\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"width:525.125px;text-align:center;\">\n<span style=\"font-weight:600;\">​TOTAL BUDGET <br/>RESERVED</span><br/></th></tr><tr class=\"ms-rteTableOddRow-4\"><td class=\"ms-rteTableEvenCol-4\">\n<span style=\"font-weight:600;\">​$4,000,000</span><br/></td><td class=\"ms-rteTableOddCol-4\" colspan=\"1\"><strong><span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;vertical-align:baseline;\"><span style=\"font-weight:600;text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight:600;text-align:center;\">13.96%​</span></span></span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size:1rem;\">​</span><br/></td><td class=\"ms-rteTableEvenCol-4\"><span><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align:center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;vertical-align:baseline;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;text-align:center;\">0.38%​</span></span>​</span>​</span>​</span></p></span></td></tr></tbody></table><div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<span style=\"font-weight:600;\">​<br/>Last Update to Total Budget Reserved: October 9, 2026</span></div><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight:600;\"><span class=\"ms-rteBackColor-4\"><br/></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-weight:600;\"><span class=\"ms-rteBackColor-4\"></span></span><div><strong>FY27 Program Documents: </strong>The ​​​​FY27 documents are available below and on the MyMEA portal <a href=\"https://mea.maryland.gov/rces-program-details\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.<br/></div><div><br/></div><div><div style=\"text-decoration:underline;\">Please read for specific information, criteria, and requirements.</div><div><br/></div><div><ul><li><a href=\"/SiteAssets/Pages/EnergyStorage/FY27%20RCES%20Funding%20Opportunity%20Announcement%20-%20Issued%209.24.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">FY27 RCES Funding Opportunity Announcement (FOA) - Issued 9.24.26​</a></li><li><a href=\"/SiteAssets/Pages/EnergyStorage/FOA%20Attachment%20A1%20-%20FY27%20RCES%20Authorizations%20-%20Cash%20or%20Loan%20%281%29.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">FOA Attachment A1 - RCES Authorizations &amp; Disclosures Form - Energy Storage System Purchase (Outright or with Loan Financing) - Issued 9.23.26</a></li><li><a href=\"/SiteAssets/Pages/EnergyStorage/FOA%20Attachment%20A2%20-%20FY27%20RCES%20Authorizations%20%26%20Disclosures%20Form%20-Lease%20Agreements%20-%20Issued%209.18.26%20%281%29.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">FOA Attachment A2 - RCES Authorizations &amp; Disclosures Form - Third-Party Owned Energy Storage System - Issued 9.23.26</a></li><li><a href=\"/SiteAssets/Pages/all-incentives/MEA%20Fossil%20Fuel%20Policy%20Version%201%20for%20Fiscal%20Year%202027%20-%20present.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">FOA Attachment B - MEA Fossil Fuel Policy</a></li><li><a href=\"/SiteAssets/Pages/EnergyStorage/Attachment%20C_%20Information%20about%20Virtual%20Power%20Plant%20%28VPP%29%20pilots%20under%20development%20in%20Maryland_accessible%20%20-%20Issued%209.23.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Attachment C: Information about Virtual Power Plant (VPP) pilots under development in Maryland - Issued 9.24.26</a><br/></li></ul></div></div><div>Contact Information: please direct questions to <a href=\"mailto:energystorage.mea@maryland.gov\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"781d161d0a1f010b0c170a191f1d56151d193815190a011419161c561f170e\">[email protected]</span>​</a>. </div><div><br/><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Fiscal Year 2026 (FY26) Existing Applications</strong></div><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong><br/></strong></div><div><strong>FY26 applications are no longer being accepted.  The funding opportunity announcement and third-party authorization form for the FY26 RCES program is attached below for reference only.</strong> <span style=\"font-size:1rem;\">Existing RCES applicants may login to the <a href=\"https://mdmea.my.site.com/MEAPrograms/rces-program-details\" target=\"_blank\">MyMEA portal</a>​ to check the status of their application and to make additional continuing document submissions, if requested by MEA.​​</span></div></div></div><p></p><p>\n<strong>FY26 Program Documents: </strong><br/></p><p></p><ul><li><span class=\"ms-rteThemeBackColor-1-0\"><a href=\"/SiteAssets/Pages/Energy-Storage-Grant-Program/RCES%20FOA%20V4%202.10.2026%20.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"ms-rteThemeBackColor-1-0\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"ms-asset-icon ms-rtePosition-4\" src=\"/_layouts/15/images/icpdf.png\"/>RCES FOA V4 2.10.2026</span></a></span><br/></li><li>\n<a href=\"/SiteAssets/Pages/Energy-Storage-Grant-Program/Authorized%20Applicant%20Signature%20Form%20-%20RCES.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"ms-asset-icon ms-rtePosition-4\" src=\"/_layouts/15/images/icpdf.png\"/>FY26 RCES Grant Program Third-Party Customer Authorization Form</a><br/></li></ul><div><span style=\"text-align:center;font-size:1rem;\">Individuals are entitled to request an accessible version of any electronic document presented on this website. See more information here: <a href=\"/Pages/Accessibility-Request.aspx\" target=\"_blank\">https://energy.maryland.gov/Pages/Accessibility-Request.aspx</a>  <a href=\"https://mdmea.my.site.com/MEAPrograms/rces-program-details\" target=\"_blank\">​</a></span></div><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><br/></div><p></p><p>\n<strong>Contact Information:</strong> Please contact MEA’s Energy Storage Team at <a href=\"mailto:energystorage.mea@maryland.gov\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"72371c1700150b21061d001315175c3f3733323f13000b1e131c165c151d04\">[email protected]</span></a><br/></p><p>\n<strong>Stay Informed:</strong> Follow the Maryland Energy Administration for the latest updates and announcements: <a href=\"/Pages/news.aspx\" target=\"_blank\">MEA News Page</a> | \r\n      <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/maryland-energy-administration/\" target=\"_blank\">LinkedIn</a> ​| \r\n      <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/%40MDEnergyAdministration/\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook</a> | \r\n      <a href=\"https://x.com/MDEnergy\" target=\"_blank\">X</a> <br/></p></div></div>\n</section>",
